### Min-8. Bare `except:` Clauses in Multiple Files

**Files:** [bulk_extractor.py](file:///c:/hackathon/Edith_t-Automater/tools/bulk-extractor/bulk_extractor.py#L46-L47), [exiftool_auto.py](file:///c:/hackathon/Edith_t-Automater/tools/exiftool/exiftool_auto.py#L118), [report_gen.py](file:///c:/hackathon/Edith_t-Automater/tools/Scripts/report_gen.py#L191)

Multiple files use bare `except:` without specifying exception types. This swallows `KeyboardInterrupt`, `SystemExit`, and other signals.

