### Min-9. Inconsistent Return Types Across Functions

| Function | Returns on success | Returns on failure |
|----------|-------------------|-------------------|
| `auto.main()` | `True` | `None` |
| `hashdeep.main()` | `dict` | `dict` |
| `exiftool_auto.process_all_evidence()` | `dict` | `dict` |
| `run_bulk_extractor()` | `None` | `None` |

Callers have no reliable way to determine success.

