### Min-10. `autopsy/auto.py` NoneType Crash in `get_partition_offset`

**File:** [auto.py](file:///c:/hackathon/Edith_t-Automater/tools/autopsy/auto.py#L54-L61)

If `run_cmd` returns `None`, the next line `output.splitlines()` crashes. Should add `if output is None: return None, None`.

